From 5f49e4d81d5ff12ce7d15c8cb8e17167c85812fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 05:14:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Export: one failing analysis or block no longer fails the
 whole file

- report results: an analysis that cannot be computed is skipped and logged
  instead of failing the export with a bare 500
- PowerPoint: each block is drawn on its own; a block that cannot be drawn
  becomes a slide that says so
- the export dialog shows the server's message, or the start of the
  platform's answer when it is not JSON (a timeout, a crash)
- deploy tracing: the story routes carry the ffmpeg binary (glob key for the
  dynamic route; the version path for pnpm)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Hr35SrsN44edhJ8Z6mmA87
