From ddc95ce23e462c3919f7e219ae30f11b3c9be36c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:48:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Deploy: keep the report-video functions small and on
 their own

The story routes traced the ffmpeg binary twice (157 MB of a 173 MB
function) and shared settings with every other API route, so Vercel could
bundle them together past its function size limit. One copy of the binary
(94 MB in all) and their own maxDuration (300 s), so they deploy as
separate functions.

